---
import ProductLayout from '@/layouts/ProductLayout.astro';
import { MATTRESS_SPECS } from '@/data/specs';
import { pageTitle } from '@/lib/seo';
---

<ProductLayout
  title={pageTitle('Hotel Mattresses')}
  description="Pocket spring hotel mattresses, 110 to 180 cm wide, 20 to 30 cm deep, tested to 16 CFR 1633. Wholesale."
  h1="Hotel mattresses"
  breadcrumb="Mattresses"
  specs={MATTRESS_SPECS}
  images={['products-mattresses-hero', 'products-mattresses-detail']}
>
  <p>
    Our hotel mattress is a pocket-spring build in 110, 120, 150 and 180 cm widths, all 200 cm
    long, in 20, 25 or 30 cm depth. Medium firm is the standard. The comfort layer changes if a
    project specifies otherwise; the spring unit does not.
  </p>
  <p>
    The fire barrier is 220 g fire-retardant cotton and 90 g fire-retardant foam over the spring
    unit. The build is tested to 16 CFR 1633 at SGS Shunde, report SDFTS25002706R05_EN, and the
    report is available on request.
  </p>
  <p>
    For the full build options, including double-sided and topper versions, see the mattress
    supplier page. This page is the range summary.
  </p>
  <p>
    <a class="font-semibold underline" href="/hotel-mattress-supplier/">Mattress supplier page</a>
  </p>
</ProductLayout>
